    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im trying to help a friend who just started a small fintech company. they are getting buried in all these new compliance and reporting requirements and it's basically eating their whole budget. i need to write a pitch to some investors explaining why the current regulatory environment is making it impossible for small players to compete. can u help me outline the main points for why these regulations are hurting innovation?",
