      "content": "You should focus on how compliance introduces disproportionate overhead costs for small fintechs. Highlight that large, established players can afford dedicated compliance departments, creating an unfair barrier to entry for nimble startups. Furthermore, argue that the time and resources spent on bureaucracy distracts management from core product innovation and growth. This disparity effectively allows incumbents to stifle competition through regulatory friction.",
