    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just hard to see how all that \"protection\" actually works when it just ends up protecting the big banks from competition. in your opinion, is there actually a way to balance safety with innovation, or is the current regulatory approach fundamentally broken for startups?",
      "source": "evaluator"
