      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not entirely an either/or situation; a balance is theoretically possible but currently difficult to achieve in practice. Many advocate for \"proportional regulation,\" where compliance burdens scale with a company's size and risk exposure. The current system often applies one-size-fits-all rules that disadvantage small, innovative players. Shifting towards outcome-based regulation, rather than prescriptive rule-following, is often presented as a viable solution.",
